{
  "id": 442111418,
  "iid": 22875,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "nl80211: Add support for more nested attributes",
  "description": "Add support for following nested attributes:\n- `NL80211_ATTR_SOFTWARE_IFTYPES`\n- `NL80211_ATTR_BSS_PARAM`\n- `NL80211_ATTR_NAN_CAPABILITIES`\n- `NL80211_ATTR_SUPPORTED_COMMANDS`\n- `NL80211_ATTR_WIPHY_RADIOS`\n\nThe attribute/index for the nested `NL80211_ATTR_WIPHY_RADIOS` is incorrect (adds `0x80` to each), but that can be addressed later.\n\n![nl80211_attr_software_iftypes](/uploads/ec1d11ce066ffae486d051d22c51508e/nl80211_attr_software_iftypes.png){width=476 height=85}\n\n![nl80211_attr_bss_param](/uploads/34d0208b259bb9b6e45f57852698e508/nl80211_attr_bss_param.png){width=497 height=190}\n\n![nl80211_attr_nan_capabilities](/uploads/27006cfa392c200904f765437b13a07a/nl80211_attr_nan_capabilities.png){width=549 height=134}\n\n![nl80211_attr_supported_commands](/uploads/0175351b3b9128e5d4fcb51e1f46d3c6/nl80211_attr_supported_commands.png){width=476 height=600}\n\n![nl80211_attr_wiphy_radios](/uploads/1cb7b2a63e518a44fd41326ee5572d6d/nl80211_attr_wiphy_radios.png){width=592 height=411}",
